## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- [PlatformIO](https://platformio.org/install)
- [AWS CLI](https://aws.amazon.com/cli/) configured with `nakom.is-sandbox` profile
- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) for CDK

### Initial Setup

1. **Deploy AWS Infrastructure:**
   ```bash
   cd infra
   npm install
   cdk deploy
   ```

2. **Generate Secrets:**
   ```bash
   cd embedded/scripts
   python generate_secrets.py
   ```

3. **Factory Flash:**
   ```bash
   ./factory_setup.sh
   ```

## Development

### Build & Flash

```bash
cd embedded/scripts
./build_and_flash.sh
```

### Upload to S3 (OTA)

```bash
python build_and_upload.py           # Patch version bump
python build_and_upload.py --minor   # Minor version bump
```

## OTA Updates

Updates are delivered via the [sandboxsite](https://sandbox.nakomis.com):

1. Connect to device via Bluetooth
2. Configure WiFi if needed
3. Select firmware version and trigger update
4. Device downloads firmware, writes to SD, reboots
5. Bootloader flashes update from SD to OTA partition

